// Application manifest for test executables on Windows (MinGW): use UTF-8 as
// the ANSI code page, which is used as the local charset by windowsHandler,
// as some tests expect the local charset to be UTF-8.
// This replaces the default manifest added by the MinGW toolchain.

1 24 "utf8.manifest"  // CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, RT_MANIFEST
